<title>FRANCE: Tunisia importers buy 48,000 T optional soft wheat.</title>
<headline>Tunisia importers buy 48,000 T optional soft wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private Tunisian importers recently bought 48,000 tonnes of optional soft wheat, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Pricing details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The wheat came in three lots of 16,000 tonnes each, they said.</p>
<p>The European Union was likely to supply one cargo for May shipment and the United States the others for shipment during second half June and second half July, one exporter said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
